rx="656" lry="732" /><zone xml:id="m-b0c9668e-6a1c-404a-b664-1c228bb2c128" ulx="172" uly="722" lrx="1031" lry="759" /><zone xml:id="m-7dca58cd-3965-4129-9794-b2023e203ac4" ulx="144" uly="749" lrx="739" lry="789" /><zone xml:id="m-bd2f29de-9bd5-4eb4-9cf3-3125ce3be9ba" ulx="173" uly="779" lrx="610" lry="818" /><zone xml:id="m-a8787b09-5710-46f3-8d53-fc784ed77115" ulx="172" uly="809" lrx="1028" lry="845" /><zone xml:id="m-48a31145-9976-4d44-83dc-cc04be25c04a" ulx="173" uly="840" lrx="617" lry="880" /><zone xml:id="m-ceb241c0-a270-47e5-8308-738c9ec315fe" ulx="173" uly="873" lrx="618" lry="909" /><zone xml:id="m-370c4dc4-285a-4fa6-b416-89104a0c37fe" ulx="172" uly="900" lrx="873" lry="937" /><zone xml:id="m-a6557ee5-7154-4ac6-97b3-6574050ecca3" ulx="174" uly="934" lrx="998" lry="972" /><zone xml:id="m-ddf5e143-891c-44ac-a54c-d74166647624" ulx="173" uly="964" lrx="637" lry="1002" /><zone xml:id="m-e69e3697-532d-40d7-99f3-d3c2b719a7cf" ulx="174" uly="994" lrx="586" lry="1028" /><zone xml:id="m-ea2c68bf-0784-43eb-837f-5c8713e7ebaf" ulx="173" uly="1057" lrx="1037" lry="1099" /><zone xml:id="m-80d9fb7d-3317-4c32-8178-a532ca2633aa" ulx="146" uly="1087" lrx="1037" lry="1122" /><zone xml:id="m-5c9c6f9a-74c7-4d77-9d60-872a0346bee2" ulx="149" uly="1114" lrx="1036" lry="1155" /><zone xml:id="m-eea09f10-9575-4648-87a9-7f80193f3880" ulx="147" uly="1148" lrx="626" lry="1180" /><zone xml:id="m-b65f3e64-63bb-4f35-bdfe-839890aeed52" ulx="176" uly="1173" lrx="1036" lry="1215" /><zone xml:id="m-799f9553-52ad-4e14-935a-80cca9b29dee" ulx="146" uly="1203" lrx="687" lry="1240" /><zone xml:id="m-edff22af-9514-4ddc-b446-a5f54394a37c" ulx="172" uly="1239" lrx="758" lry="1282" /><zone xml:id="m-31dc0477-1e60-496f-a37a-04dcac286d71" ulx="253" uly="1281" lrx="375" lry="1316" /><zone xml:id="m-0053b460-1895-4038-b54d-8c9bd70ee1dd" ulx="825" uly="1282" lrx="927" lry="1321" /><zone xml:id="m-b8f53439-e555-48c2-b4b9-f3c757def010" ulx="147" uly="1311" lrx="1038" lry="1352" /><zone xml:id="m-512d777e-dc96-4f42-b87c-7a0dc5df2ff4" ulx="177" uly="1343" lrx="1038" lry="1380" /><zone xml:id="m-428c329b-db98-4f86-83f8-9d6127d59ae8" ulx="147" uly="1370" lrx="821" lry="1409" /><zone xml:id="m-c30da7d7-6a67-46f0-afc7-6de0b5a5bb50" ulx="149" uly="1403" lrx="588" lry="1436" /><zone xml:id="m-a1767ddc-8cd2-4769-bebb-44e6c28e3a0b" ulx="171" uly="1440" lrx="536" lry="1475" /><zone xml:id="m-a78e803f-7a65-4576-9b1a-3a808f8e008b" ulx="148" uly="1472" lrx="1038" lry="1506" /><zone xml:id="m-a72c92e8-f1f2-4d88-87ef-d9982f49aaf6" ulx="175" uly="1500" lrx="1035" lry="1538" /><zone xml:id="m-2d2052b5-bf35-43c4-8a80-3605a1d9dafb" ulx="150" uly="1530" lrx="588" lry="1567" /><zone xml:id="m-125eec16-b2d3-4515-8834-a656a4e38f74" ulx="596" uly="1530" lrx="817" lry="1575" /><zone xml:id="m-5d837eb8-42b3-4a9a-aa0f-6e14b17ce862" ulx="151" uly="1557" lrx="582" lry="1598" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-bcf97d66-c195-4624-ae81-e8b2fe35e7dc" n="2132" facs="#m-59f3955b-ff43-4660-af27-2eb484aa3391" /><div xml:id="m-cec3f6dd-1049-4664-8a26-69c2efc0d7c2">
            <lg xml:id="m-0f89d65a-596e-4ae7-ab65-95466770cbf5">
              <l xml:id="m-01a1e985-1906-48f9-94e6-c084214c2755" facs="#m-7c44f634-ec8f-49a2-ba61-0bf712463581" label="ambiguous">Appendix.</l><l xml:id="m-9b8b1e66-52ed-4d6e-9a65-609ab520e612" facs="#m-935b6148-b87c-4e80-b790-ca9047f9412f" label="lyrics-like">5. Exsultent et laeténtur in te ómnes qui quaérunt te:* et dicant</l><l xml:id="m-4b202866-3d4b-4ea3-8f56-281a00bba45c" facs="#m-2308a031-80e8-4367-96c5-c42289984274" label="lyrics-like">semper : Magnificétur Dóminus: qui diligunt salutáre túum.</l><l xml:id="m-3517ddc2-74f8-4cfd-9e01-f6a44f60618a" facs="#m-8943ed57-8b90-4a6e-a5eb-1b0631076115" label="lyrics-like">6. Ego vero egénus et páuper sum: * Déus ádjuva me.</l><l xml:id="m-4f13bec2-f8b6-4820-bef3-85f2e6436dbd" facs="#m-770e7532-a02a-41ae-93ea-033742c5f8eb" label="lyrics-like">7. Adjútor méus et liberátor méus és tu :* Dómine ne moréris.</l><l xml:id="m-7f8775a4-de29-4fc8-bac1-a585d5dc25ed" facs="#m-1dc6de81-d205-4ecc-81d3-71caa77236b3" label="lyrics-like">8. Glória Pá̂tri, et Filio. * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-120a539b-7f45-4045-940e-142dceeb3dc9" facs="#m-28376c9f-604a-4bb8-b3d6-1d0f95f62731" label="lyrics-like">9. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8005ab3-bacc-4b8c-a857-4a304b2bc4f9" facs="#m-c66cacd4-81ad-4a90-9b33-7472062cbd04" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1595d513-b582-4ea1-88c6-067bad5eb024" facs="#m-dabd67c0-7a68-45b2-9ffa-2a61002b5279" label="lyrics-like">V. Sálvos fac sérvos túos.</l><l xml:id="m-e5184278-86ef-44a4-abf0-8b7fbd52e7e7" facs="#m-06f5d9dc-219b-4968-8ac2-bc6381a3fb9c" label="lyrics-like">K. Déus méus sperántes in te.</l><l xml:id="m-9f5f9bfa-3b64-4b97-9d65-15260f2049a3" facs="#m-42f751e9-aed1-4127-b9e7-d5ddc34835a5" label="lyrics-like">V. Esto nóbis Dómine túrris fortitúdinis.</l><l xml:id="m-1bfd997e-73f4-48b3-8ea4-6244f3b488c2" facs="#m-178be26c-a2ae-413f-b92c-e36d31f4f943" label="lyrics-like">R. A fácie inimici.</l><l xml:id="m-295592c5-3ecf-47e5-9817-4ff69457cba8" facs="#m-17241d57-8f81-4cc4-ba3d-539173fc158e" label="lyrics-like">V. Nihil proficiat inimícus in nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-566d5fa1-f1b4-4cc8-ad96-191045ad8f99" facs="#m-3ca10cb0-d43e-4824-9c70-a987f51b5df8" label="lyrics-like">B. Et fllius iniquitátis non appónat nocére nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-2e8adbd8-dde8-452b-bcd5-37f5f606574e" facs="#m-ef0b468e-d772-4e25-b858-ec41ffb6958b" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine non secúndum peccáta nóstra fácias nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-ae34d94f-e2e4-4226-8f68-bb4cb4a2fea1" facs="#m-509e238b-8b09-4839-8f4c-62f4b1afb17a" label="lyrics-like">K. Neque secúndum iniquitátes nóstras retribuas nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-ba01be14-26be-4ba3-b7b1-58f0c5231b70" facs="#m-62510c1e-03e3-4940-b31d-79395e3a7a2a" label="lyrics-like">V. Orémus pro Pontífice nóstro N.</l><l xml:id="m-eed20026-6673-41fa-bf35-4eb04a2974e3" facs="#m-12b30927-cf6c-40c9-b569-0e2668b50d7d" label="lyrics-like">R. Dóminus consérvet éum, et vivíficet éum, f et beátum fáciat éum</l><l xml:id="m-b441e504-1bf5-46af-bffe-52da6892fdda" facs="#m-f663d057-6878-4206-abb8-84703b8a59b4" label="lyrics-like">in térra, * et non trádat éum in ánimam inimicórum éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-b6250117-650d-4781-8a4d-b0d08cbff729" facs="#m-2b3ad6a5-9f03-45d9-aa8b-95b787a78c6f" label="lyrics-like">V. Orémus pro benefactóribus nóstris.</l><l xml:id="m-302a7517-3c14-476f-8d2c-bbf2e39c61cc" facs="#m-b0c9668e-6a1c-404a-b664-1c228bb2c128" label="lyrics-like">R. Retribúere dignáre Dómine, t ómnibus nóbis bóna faciéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-024669f8-90a2-4d08-b577-2e4a04dcf10c" facs="#m-7dca58cd-3965-4129-9794-b2023e203ac4" label="lyrics-like">propter nómen túum, “ vitam aetérnam. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-dd3807c8-5e2e-4e9a-b867-56c11d9a4707" facs="#m-bd2f29de-9bd5-4eb4-9cf3-3125ce3be9ba" label="lyrics-like">V. Orémus pro fidélibus defúnctis.</l><l xml:id="m-e7786977-2320-4bf6-9bc3-2b537ad8adb8" facs="#m-a8787b09-5710-46f3-8d53-fc784ed77115" label="lyrics-like">E. Réquiem aetérnam dóna éts Dómine, * et lux perpétua lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-ea93b575-da0e-4446-ae8d-ad1bbc6c22b6" facs="#m-48a31145-9976-4d44-83dc-cc04be25c04a" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscant in pâce. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-1163ffde-1e23-46e3-8e48-7416f3d6a380" facs="#m-ceb241c0-a270-47e5-8308-738c9ec315fe" label="lyrics-like">V. Pro frátribus nóstris absentibus.</l><l xml:id="m-509c845f-2119-4f0a-a4c4-2ba726319a12" facs="#m-370c4dc4-285a-4fa6-b416-89104a0c37fe" label="lyrics-like">R. Sálvos fac sérvos tüos,“Déus méus, sperántes in te.</l><l xml:id="m-79138d08-8cb5-462a-802c-7a986d04c284" facs="#m-a6557ee5-7154-4ac6-97b3-6574050ecca3" label="lyrics-like">V. Mitte éis Dómine auxilium de sancto. K. Et de Ston tuére éos.</l><l xml:id="m-7a64cf3b-2744-4e5e-90d1-69569079efe9" facs="#m-ddf5e143-891c-44ac-a54c-d74166647624" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine exáudi oratiónem méam.</l><l xml:id="m-7468a988-5560-4dc1-8696-3412f7e9020b" facs="#m-e69e3697-532d-40d7-99f3-d3c2b719a7cf" label="lyrics-like">K. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-28c684ed-4065-41df-b243-62142747c9c4" facs="#m-ea2c68bf-0784-43eb-837f-5c8713e7ebaf" label="text-like">On the day of Deposition there follow here the incensation of the</l><l xml:id="m-b27101b1-88cc-468a-9a37-c411bf112903" facs="#m-80d9fb7d-3317-4c32-8178-a532ca2633aa" label="lyrics-like">Blessed Sacrament, the Procession, and Tántum ergo. After the</l><l xml:id="m-059d5110-2004-4ff6-8d86-9e28ec040032" facs="#m-5c9c6f9a-74c7-4d77-9d60-872a0346bee2" label="lyrics-like">V. Pânem de caélo etc., the Celebrant (omitting Dóminus vobiscum)</l><l xml:id="m-636952ed-b734-4121-9fde-e95cf747e951" facs="#m-eea09f10-9575-4648-87a9-7f80193f3880" label="text-like">stands and sings the following prayers.</l><l xml:id="m-82bd63eb-1b2c-43c1-b089-80c7a91674e3" facs="#m-b65f3e64-63bb-4f35-bdfe-839890aeed52" label="lyrics-like">But on the day of Exposition, immediately after Y. Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-c5c18918-0f4a-450f-a770-a329e0a43c16" facs="#m-799f9553-52ad-4e14-935a-80cca9b29dee" label="lyrics-like">exáudi etc. the Celebrant stands and sings:</l><l xml:id="m-02d9cd15-605c-404a-9b3c-b7f979369cd1" facs="#m-edff22af-9514-4ddc-b446-a5f54394a37c" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. E. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-f37bcb07-e22f-4edc-a4df-325f6fed6337" facs="#m-31dc0477-1e60-496f-a37a-04dcac286d71" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-c349aafd-9c58-43cb-a111-996ce64710ae" facs="#m-0053b460-1895-4038-b54d-8c9bd70ee1dd" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-8a56257d-3d68-4599-8c2a-67a1d0df9b0d" facs="#m-b8f53439-e555-48c2-b4b9-f3c757def010" label="lyrics-like">1. D Eus, qui nobis subSacraménto tui sacra mystéria venerári; * ut</l><l xml:id="m-b3cd21f9-cf66-4648-8b52-8477f0260635" facs="#m-512d777e-dc96-4f42-b87c-7a0dc5df2ff4" label="lyrics-like">U mirábili passiónis tuae memó-redemptiónis tuae fructum in nobis</l><l xml:id="m-50483eb0-fcfb-45fd-a81c-de5b4013c076" facs="#m-428c329b-db98-4f86-83f8-9d6127d59ae8" label="lyrics-like">riam reliquísti: t tribue, quaésu- júgiter sentiámus.</l><l xml:id="m-ae578ce9-4f92-4583-889b-2ed8d87ff0e5" facs="#m-c30da7d7-6a67-46f0-afc7-6de0b5a5bb50" label="lyrics-like">mus, ita nos Córporis et Sánguinis</l><l xml:id="m-25afba03-a4a2-4dc4-883f-92374e004082" facs="#m-a1767ddc-8cd2-4769-bebb-44e6c28e3a0b" label="text-like">From Advent until Christmas:</l><l xml:id="m-35746e5d-ac53-4ad6-b570-e35dda01219c" facs="#m-a78e803f-7a65-4576-9b1a-3a808f8e008b" label="lyrics-like">2. D Eus, qui de beátae Maríae Vir-[ut, qui vere eam Genitrícem Der</l><l xml:id="m-69782f44-2531-42e4-b724-7c6543faf810" facs="#m-a72c92e8-f1f2-4d88-87ef-d9982f49aaf6" label="lyrics-like">U ginis útero Verbumtuum, An-lcrédimus, ejus apud te intercessió¬</l><l xml:id="m-b26e9a9b-792e-4254-ac77-2dbaa13cd269" facs="#m-2d2052b5-bf35-43c4-8a80-3605a1d9dafb" label="lyrics-like">gelo nuntiánte, carnem suscipere</l><l xml:id="m-ab1d9b08-60de-4931-b12f-a5402e05f69f" facs="#m-125eec16-b2d3-4515-8834-a656a4e38f74" label="lyrics-like">nibus adjuvémur.</l><l xml:id="m-ea06f3ad-a06f-4c57-8056-b60f66eb5830" facs="#m-5d837eb8-42b3-4a9a-aa0f-6e14b17ce862" label="ambiguous">voluisti :t praesta supplicibus tuis;?</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>